neo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aNaQtkWKdA4Q7kNvwH4hzJe&_nc_oc=AdmnFpc9QWcC3vwBYztf_BwoyD9S9bgwSeoPdldVd7kTWoojCBtfnSDd30WVbHnRbww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuzRHIz9q18G42Q-z4b02En0HNINggbrsZnBlNOXj4EdA&oe=69A02CF4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DOIpGF3wOvgQ7kNvwH6GNr8&_nc_oc=AdnMbgIcPeWdvxEHDfS9TUtDS5BMsujzC87d8c-Fut90gUoEheASwsozqbQKVsiR7tk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuVVN-Av3nCVi8nVdQBzD40bUdjqG5w51Qmns8PToeoXw&oe=69A02E56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3mawh5w-6lAQ7kNvwF1d7BY&_nc_oc=AdnjWwfDr_O2IDygSlqk1b83QogFdZFjpAXFx6PsvvPYf3gDOhikvkGAWHDdkV9f61k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftprjGd8BYfpKPRXSam4VZYpzS51FNI7K5IoC1Gqrs59Q&oe=69A04377"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974472_629709421448022_713197402145434487_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_